{"id":"word:hebrew:H3602","type":"word","title":"כָּכָה","subtitle":"H3602 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"just so , referring to the previous or following context","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to כָּכָה (H3602) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: adv.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 37 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"כָּכָה (kâkâh) means just so , referring to the previous or following context First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 1 6."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"כָּכָה","transliteration":"kâkâh","pronunciation":"kaw'-kaw","strong":"H3602","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3602","partOfSpeech":"adv","forms":["כָּ֣כָה","כָּ֔כָה","כָּ֚כָה","כָּ֛כָה","כָּ֖כָה"],"morphs":[["HD",33],["HC/D",2],["HTr/D",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"just so , referring to the previous or following context","usage":"after that (this) manner, this matter, (even) so, in such a case, thus.","full":"H3602. kakah כָּ֫כָה 37 adverb thus (Late Hebrew abbreviated to כָּךְ , with prepositions כָּךְ בֵּין meanwhile , לְפִיכָךְ therefore ; probably either from כָה and כְּ , literally as thus , Ol § 223 h ; or from כָה כָּה Kö ii. 1, 253 ), somewhat more emphatic than כֹּה , usually prefixed to word which it qualifies: — Exod 12:11 אתו תאכלו וככה and thus shall ye eat it, 29:35 ; Num 8:26 ; 11:15 לי עשׂה את ככה ואם , 15:11-12 , 13 ; Deut 25:9 ; 29:23 (compare 1Kin 9:8 ; Jer 22:8 ); so often with עשׂה : 1Sam 19:17 רמיתני ככה למה why hast thou thus deceived me ? 2Sam 17:21 ; 1Kin 1:6 , 48 ; Jer 13:9 ; 19:11 ; 28:11 ; 51:64 ; once with an adjective 2Sam 13:4 דל כָכָה אתה מדוע why art thou thus lean ? Eccl 11:5 answering to כַּאֲשֶׁר ; Psa 144:15 לוֺ שֶׁכָּכָה העם the people to which it is thus. Once 2Chr 18:19 repeated, in this way . . . in that way (|| 1Kin 22:20 בְּכֹהבְּ֗֗֗כֹה ). compare the synonym כָּזֹאת . With a preposition once, in late Hebrew, Est 9:26 עַלכָּֿ֫כָה concerning such a matter. With the interrogative אֵיכָכָה אי, how ? (p. 32).","rootNote":"from 3541 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 1 6","keyReferences":["1Kgs 1 6","1Kgs 1 48","1Kgs 9 8","1Sam 2 14","1Sam 19 17","2Chr 7 21","2Chr 18 19","2Chr 18 19"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":37,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 1 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֣כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 48","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":48,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֖כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֔כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"1Sam 2 14","book":"1Sam","chapter":2,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֚כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 17","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֨כָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"2Chr 7 21","book":"2Chr","chapter":7,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֔כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"2Chr 18 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":18,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֔כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"2Chr 18 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":18,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּֽכָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"2Sam 13 4","book":"2Sam","chapter":13,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֣כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"2Sam 17 21","book":"2Sam","chapter":17,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָ֛כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"Deut 25 9","book":"Deut","chapter":25,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֚כָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HD"},{"reference":"Deut 29 23","book":"Deut","chapter":29,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ֖כָה","source":"hebrew